Day 23
--------

CSS Selectors -->for designing web pages
-------------
It is one of the most useful locators after id, name, and className.

*tag id                tag#id ->if id is available
*tag class             tag.classname
*tag attribute         tag[attribute="value"] -> if id and classname is not available
*tag class attribute   tag.classname[attribute="value"]


# means ID.
. means class.

